        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Hollow Sieve remote access trojan sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01849. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Hollow Sieve Remote Access Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01849)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Hollow Sieve Remote Access Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Hollow Sieve remote access trojan in campaign PTF-01849.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"373b871ffbaf7871a0645dc020e416b336bb86632bc564b0f748649fe95992a6\", \"05d5f966affe903372a69e8e7d4e071c990ca7d19b4f79102bb9e68b7cf10a3a\", \"3f5f1db4a074f1f49bc95044eae311da69d4417e0ea341e95a9f8c362150286c\", \"a6a1b9cba1d99079ec94c0507004902c4af31de4cf003d9d11e702be69367189\", \"d9d4efc926de76110056e1cf4511e744895a56948a4b8d737535a2a60bb322ff\", \"a4f35c7630edb1461005b2258da9edda8885a115d25113ee1f76794babfa87fe\", \"421adac651b7d0d0a967f841f7afe2b70d416c625ef689b116063e618a44b264\", \"716ac2846c0801d4c2f8ece36384fa14b224e97a8776c4272a603440cc943881\", \"90421b9506b38d1768799fd232539d2295893d9a102f07ab8164f64ff03526d0\", \"dd55af5e082632a9da5124f5f766ae2a9fd9b55cea93d4d010dd700ec4a9e244\")",
